tm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a global leader in materials science and digital identification solutions. We are Making PossibleTM products and solutions that help advance the industries we serve, providing branding and information solutions that optimize labor and supply chain efficiency, reduce waste and mitigate loss, advance sustainability, circularity and transparency, and better connect brands and consumers. We design and develop labeling and functional materials, radio-frequency identification (\"RFID\") inlays and tags, software applications that connect the physical and digital, and offerings that enhance branded packaging and carry or display information that improves the customer experience. We serve an array of industries worldwide, including home and personal care, apparel, general retail, e-commerce, logistics, food and grocery, pharmaceuticals and automotive.","zh":"我們是材料科學和數位識別解決方案的全球領導者。我們正在製造可能™產品和解決方案，幫助推動我們所服務的產業發展，提供品牌和資訊解決方案，優化勞動力和供應鏈效率，減少浪費和減少損失，促進永續性、循環性和透明度，並更好地連接品牌和消費者。我們設計和開發標籤和功能材料、無線射頻識別 (“RFID”) 嵌體和標籤、連接實體和數位的軟體應用程序，以及增強品牌包裝和攜帶或顯示資訊以改善客戶體驗的產品。我們為全球多個行業提供服務，包括家居和個人護理、服裝、一般零售、電子商務、物流、食品和雜貨、製藥和汽車。"},{"en":"We believe that our exposure to diverse and growing markets, the size and scale of operations, our innovation capabilities, productivity culture, and brand strength are the primary advantages in maintaining and further developing our competitive position.","zh":"我們相信，我們對多元化和不斷增長的市場的接觸、經營規模和規模、我們的創新能力、生產力文化和品牌實力是維持和進一步發展我們競爭地位的主要優勢。"},{"en":"Our reportable segments for fiscal year 2025 were Materials Group and Solutions Group, which comprised approximately 69% and 31%, respectively, of our total net sales.","zh":"我們 2025 財年的可報告部門是材料集團和解決方案集團，分別占我們總淨銷售額的約 69% 和 31%。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"With approximately 69% of our 2025 net sales originating outside the U.S. and approximately 40% of our net sales originating in emerging markets (Latin America, Eastern Europe, Middle East/Northern Africa, and most countries in Asia Pacific), our employees are located in more than 50 countries to best serve our customers. Approximately 83% of our employees at year-end 2025 were located outside the U.S. and approximately 67% were located in emerging markets.","zh":"2025 年，我們約 69% 的淨銷售額來自美國以外，約 40% 的淨銷售額來自新興市場（拉丁美洲、東歐、中東/北非以及亞太地區的大多數國家），我們的員工分佈在 50 多個國家/地區，以便為我們的客戶提供最佳服務。截至 2025 年底，我們約有 83% 的員工位於美國境外，約 67% 位於新興市場。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Materials Group","val":6093300000,"zh":"材料集團部門"},{"name":"Solutions Group","val":2762200000,"zh":"解決方案集團部門"}],"total":8855500000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":2751000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia","val":2726800000,"zh":"亞洲"},{"name":"Europe The Middle East & North Africa","val":2457100000,"zh":"歐洲 中東和北非"},{"name":"China Including Hong Kong","val":1350000000,"zh":"中國（含香港）"},{"name":"Latin America","val":567300000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"},{"name":"Other International","val":353300000,"zh":"其他國際"}],"total":8855500000}},"peers":["AIZ","ALLE","DOV","PKG","IFF"]}}